---
// src/components/CTACommunity.astro
// Section 05 — Join the Build / community CTA with builder note and value list.

const ctaItems = [
  "Weekly AI workflow discoveries",
  "Early access to runtime kits",
  "Behind-the-scenes build logs",
  "Community signal filtering",
];
---

<section class="cta-section" id="community">
  <div class="builder-note">
    <span class="note-badge">📝 Runtime Log</span>
    <p>
      "I don't build AI tools. I build systems that let me run my life with less
      friction. Zephyr is just the public trace of that process."
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2>Join the Evolution</h2>
  <p>Not a newsletter. A runtime partnership.</p>

  <div class="cta-list">
    {ctaItems.map((item) => (
      <div class="cta-item">
        <span class="cta-check">→</span>
        <span>{item}</span>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <a href="#" class="cta-button">Join →</a>

  <div class="cta-stats">1,247 builders • 94% open rate</div>
</section>
